Version: 1.0
desc: Ear Worm Ambisonic Binaural Decoder (SPARTA AmbiBIN port) by chmaha
tags: spatial ambisonics binaural decoder headphones hoa 3d
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Decodes a 1st to 7th order ambisonic scene to headphones with head-related transfer functions (HRTFs) of a
  KEMAR dummy head (Genelec Aural ID, 836 directions). Five decoder designs: least squares (LS), LS with
  diffuse-field EQ, spatial resampling (SPR), time alignment (TA) and magnitude least squares (MagLS, the
  default), with optional max-rE weighting, diffuse covariance matching and truncation EQ, plus built-in scene
  rotation for head tracking. ACN or FuMa input with N3D, SN3D or FuMa normalisation. Settings are redesigned in
  the background while the previous decoder keeps playing.
  Ported from SPARTA AmbiBIN and the Spatial_Audio_Framework by Leo McCormack
  https://github.com/leomccormack/SPARTA (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/leomccormack/Spatial_Audio_Framework (ISC)
  afSTFT filterbank by Juha Vilkamo (MIT); HRIRs: Genelec Aural ID of a KEMAR dummy head, kindly provided by
  Aki Mäkivirta and Jaan Johansson (ISC, see Dependencies/EarWorm/EarWorm-LICENSE.txt)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0 license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/EarWorm/hrtf.txt
  Dependencies/EarWorm/EarWorm-LICENSE.txt

slider1:in_order=0<0,6,1{1st,2nd,3rd,4th,5th,6th,7th}>-Input Order
slider2:ch_order=0<0,1,1{ACN,FuMa}>-Channel Order
slider3:norm_type=1<0,2,1{N3D,SN3D,FuMa}>-Normalisation
slider4:dec_method=4<0,4,1{LS,LS-DiffEQ,SPR,TA,MagLS}>-Decoding Method
slider5:trunc_eq=1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Truncation EQ
slider6:hrir_pre=1<0,3,1{Off,Diffuse-field EQ,Phase simplification,EQ + Phase}>-HRIR Pre-processing
slider7:diff_match=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Diffuse Covariance Matching
slider8:max_re=1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Max-rE Weighting
slider9:rotation=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Rotation
slider10:use_rpy=0<0,1,1{Yaw-Pitch-Roll,Roll-Pitch-Yaw}>-Rotation Order
slider11:yaw=0<-180,180,0.01>-Yaw
slider12:pitch=0<-180,180,0.01>-Pitch
slider13:roll=0<-180,180,0.01>-Roll
slider14:flipyaw=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Flip Yaw
slider15:flippitch=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Flip Pitch
slider16:fliproll=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Flip Roll

